      "entry_id": "levels",
      "subject": "The Levels effect of a content stack (one effect per channel)",
      "status": "exact",
      "formula": "t = (v - in_min) Rcp(in_max - in_min) with the recording GPU's reciprocal; when gamma is not 1, t = sign(t) pow(|t|, gamma) with pow(x, g) = exp2(g log2 x) through the recording GPU's log2 and exp2 (hwmath.h tables); out = fma(t, out_max - out_min, out_min); the result is stored in the channel format.",
